# Committed evidence. docs/results is the curated home for run products a reader
# is meant to check, so the blanket *.csv rule above must not silently drop them:
# a number in a table that nobody can trace back to a file is exactly the problem
# this directory exists to solve.
!docs/results/**/*.csv
